     #   GIT_STATUS_DELAY  seconds to stall `git ... status`
     #   GIT_STATUS_FAIL   non-empty: `git ... status` exits 128 without running
+    #   GIT_REVPARSE_DELAY seconds to stall `git ... rev-parse HEAD` (gate 5)
